WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.120
Overview gives you a studio-wide starting point.

00:00:03.120 --> 00:00:08.870
Use the sidebar to open All Tickets when you need the searchable queue rather than the dashboard totals.

00:00:08.870 --> 00:00:11.970
AI Assistant is the place to report a new issue.

00:00:11.970 --> 00:00:16.490
Templates provides structured forms when you already know the kind of work you're reporting.

00:00:16.490 --> 00:00:20.130
Use the sidebar to return to Overview without changing any ticket.
